Date: Fri, 14 Aug 2026 15:32:16 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add configurable quality-guard probe profiles

Port GrokIQ-style probe recipes into grok2api quality guard: last-line /
contains / regex expected markers, a built-in QUALITY_OK profile, and an
admin catalog. Marker misses are hard failures; short marker hits are not
punished for burst TPS.
